WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.009
Hi, it's Iura.

00:02.010 --> 00:03.190
Time for a recap!

00:03.650 --> 00:05.769
Miyamura finally confessed
his feeling for Hori-san.

00:05.770 --> 00:07.589
Lots happened,
but she understood his feelings.

00:07.590 --> 00:10.109
Then a gray-haired man appeared!

00:10.110 --> 00:11.490
With that said,

00:11.990 --> 00:16.870
LIVE-EVIL FANSUBS Presents

00:12.840 --> 00:16.350
<i>Hori-san and Miyamura-kun</i>
is going to start!

00:21.410 --> 00:22.869
Kyousuke!

00:22.870 --> 00:24.389
What are you doing here?!

00:24.390 --> 00:26.289
I came to visit.

00:26.290 --> 00:28.479
You've matured quite a bit, Kyouko!

00:28.480 --> 00:29.930
Oh, not really, actually.

00:30.480 --> 00:32.920
Where do you think
you're touching?! Unbelievable!

00:32.970 --> 00:37.390
Stare ~

00:33.430 --> 00:34.380
Who's that?

00:34.381 --> 00:35.529
Lots of piercings.

00:35.530 --> 00:37.390
Put out your cigarette, Kyousuke!

00:37.850 --> 00:39.989
I smoke too. Don't you?

00:39.990 --> 00:41.410
Huh? No...

00:42.040 --> 00:45.279
Your piercings are amazing.
Did you do them yourself?

00:45.280 --> 00:46.649
Used a safety pin, right?

00:46.650 --> 00:48.400
I said, put it out.

00:51.320 --> 00:52.919
Kyouko...

00:52.920 --> 00:56.539
Adolescent girls don't kick
their dads upside the head.

00:56.540 --> 01:00.009
They do nowadays. You didn't know?

01:00.010 --> 01:02.319
So he's Hori-san's dad?

01:02.320 --> 01:03.749
Man, I'm hungry.

01:03.750 --> 01:06.499
Can you whip up something
real quick, Kyouko?

01:06.500 --> 01:10.039
What?! Oh, fine then!

01:10.040 --> 01:11.729
You don't have to entertain him, okay?

01:11.730 --> 01:13.300
Huh? Yeah...

01:14.080 --> 01:16.680
Even though she complains,
she still ends up cooking.

01:17.220 --> 01:19.390
U-Um...

01:20.810 --> 01:23.060
Hey, have a seat, all right?

01:23.770 --> 01:25.350
Uh, okay.

01:27.280 --> 01:28.280
And you are?

01:29.090 --> 01:31.229
I'm Miyamura. I attend Kiri High School.

01:31.230 --> 01:33.380
Oh, one of Kyouko's classmates, huh?

01:34.020 --> 01:34.730
Yes.

01:34.731 --> 01:36.620
You guys have school today?

01:37.260 --> 01:38.879
No, it's summer vacation right now.

01:38.880 --> 01:40.620
Oh yeah, that's right!

01:41.590 --> 01:43.529
Am I bothering you two?

01:43.530 --> 01:46.250
Huh? N-Not at all.

01:46.940 --> 01:48.540
Here, Mr. Annoying.

01:49.090 --> 01:52.639
Can you please put it on the table, Kyouko?

01:52.640 --> 01:54.300
I'll do that next time.

01:54.760 --> 01:59.389
Sorry about that. She's so aggressive.
Not sure who she takes after.

01:59.390 --> 02:01.220
Oh, no worries.

02:04.180 --> 02:05.220
No worries...

02:05.750 --> 02:08.899
Are you an only child,
Miyamura-kun? The only son?

02:08.900 --> 02:10.269
Yeah, I'm an only child.

02:10.270 --> 02:11.870
Oh?

02:12.650 --> 02:14.579
I won't let you have my daughter.

02:14.580 --> 02:15.360
What?!

02:15.361 --> 02:18.800
Just kidding! I surprised you.

02:22.870 --> 02:25.340
Say, Miyamura-kun...

02:25.870 --> 02:29.079
Kyouko! Please come over here
for a second, Kyouko-chan.

02:29.080 --> 02:30.670
What now?!

02:31.460 --> 02:35.339
I asked Miyamura-kun. So you two are...

02:35.340 --> 02:38.540
Miyamura-kun's your boyfriend, right?

02:47.680 --> 02:50.689
That's right. Got a problem with that?!

02:50.690 --> 02:53.739
Ouch! Hot, hot! I'm gonna get burned!

02:53.740 --> 02:54.899
Hori-san...

02:54.900 --> 02:56.909
I don't approve of guys with long hair.

02:56.910 --> 02:58.829
Look in the mirror before saying that.

02:58.830 --> 02:59.730
Um...

02:59.730 --> 03:00.630
Huh?

03:00.631 --> 03:03.320
I'll cut my hair shorter.

03:03.640 --> 03:07.640
It's okay. Let's just put it up for now.

03:08.550 --> 03:11.449
Please bring me some more
hair clips, Kyouko-chan.

03:11.450 --> 03:12.579
What?!

03:12.580 --> 03:18.009
I wanted another daughter,
you know, Miyamura-kun.

03:18.010 --> 03:19.339
Oh...

03:19.340 --> 03:23.639
Um, maybe I really <i>should</i> cut my hair.

03:23.640 --> 03:26.029
Well, I'll let you decide on that.

03:26.030 --> 03:27.030
Huh?

03:27.510 --> 03:30.749
I bet you're popular with the girls,
Miyamura-kun.

03:30.750 --> 03:32.809
Do you want to be with Kyouko?

03:32.810 --> 03:35.069
Uh... yes.

03:35.070 --> 03:36.939
Hori-san's the girl I like.

03:36.940 --> 03:41.809
How lovey-dovey! I want
to relive high school again!

03:41.810 --> 03:43.690
Here's a lot of hair clips.

03:44.220 --> 03:47.849
Hey, now! You're just like Yuriko
when she was young.

03:47.850 --> 03:50.750
So you were like this when you
were young, good-for-nothing dad?

03:54.010 --> 03:55.320
Kyousuke!

03:57.060 --> 03:58.060
Oh!

03:59.290 --> 04:02.219
Wh-What should we do?

04:02.220 --> 04:05.119
We don't have enough food
for you to eat tonight.

04:05.120 --> 04:06.060
You serious?!

04:06.061 --> 04:07.229
Yeah.

04:07.230 --> 04:10.549
Kyouko, Souta, me, and Izumi-kun...

04:10.550 --> 04:12.689
Uh... well, I was about to head home.

04:12.690 --> 04:14.539
You can just borrow Miyamura's dishes.

04:14.540 --> 04:16.560
You don't have enough dishes
for your own father?

04:24.920 --> 04:26.140
Miyamura.

04:27.200 --> 04:28.200
Hori-san.

04:30.130 --> 04:31.030
Your glasses.

04:31.031 --> 04:32.739
Oh, thanks.

04:32.740 --> 04:34.210
I forgot all about them.

04:42.110 --> 04:43.879
Thank you, Hori-san.

04:43.880 --> 04:45.069
Huh?

04:45.070 --> 04:48.260
Um, what you told your dad back then.

04:48.730 --> 04:49.880
That's...

04:51.590 --> 04:53.340
Um...

05:03.650 --> 05:04.799
See ya!

05:04.800 --> 05:06.240
Hori-san.

05:09.930 --> 05:11.240
What is it?

05:16.040 --> 05:17.110
See you tomorrow.

05:19.740 --> 05:20.740
Okay.

05:34.390 --> 05:36.890
Ishikawa-kun

05:46.380 --> 05:48.409
Oh... really?

05:48.410 --> 05:51.010
Okay. Uh huh. Right.

05:51.870 --> 05:54.429
Don't worry about it, you idiot.

05:54.430 --> 05:56.319
You tried your best, Miyamura.

05:56.320 --> 05:57.450
Good for you.

05:58.410 --> 06:01.549
Okay. Okay. Gotcha.

06:01.550 --> 06:02.550
Later!

06:11.550 --> 06:12.850
You're wrong.

06:13.280 --> 06:14.060
What?

06:14.061 --> 06:16.319
You're Ishikawa-kun, right?

06:16.320 --> 06:20.589
The second male student in class will be skipped
for now, so get the books from that box over there.

06:20.590 --> 06:23.659
Okay. Are you the class
president or something?

06:23.660 --> 06:25.569
Huh? No, I'm not.

06:25.570 --> 06:29.340
That hasn't been decided yet, remember?

06:31.710 --> 06:32.710
Hori...

06:33.450 --> 06:36.559
Are you good at math, Hori-san?

06:36.560 --> 06:38.460
Not really. Why?

06:38.920 --> 06:41.020
I just don't understand this part.

06:41.830 --> 06:43.950
Oh, this is...

06:44.950 --> 06:46.210
I wonder if Hori...

06:46.690 --> 06:48.339
has a boyfriend.

06:48.340 --> 06:49.530
Huh?

06:53.630 --> 06:55.100
Oh, great.

06:56.710 --> 06:58.550
How uncool.

07:01.540 --> 07:02.540
Good morning!

07:02.630 --> 07:04.669
Oh, good morning.

07:04.670 --> 07:05.670
What's wrong?

07:06.460 --> 07:07.460
Um...

07:08.510 --> 07:10.990
I told you to not to worry about it.

07:11.570 --> 07:12.390
Good morning!

07:12.391 --> 07:13.739
Good morning!

07:13.740 --> 07:14.799
Good morning!

07:14.800 --> 07:16.459
G-Good morning.

07:16.460 --> 07:18.739
What's up, Hori?! Did
you finish that worksheet?

07:18.740 --> 07:20.139
Of course.

07:20.140 --> 07:21.140
For real?

07:21.340 --> 07:22.150
Can I see it?

07:22.151 --> 07:23.380
What?!

07:23.680 --> 07:24.829
Good morning!

07:24.830 --> 07:25.790
Good morning.

07:25.790 --> 07:26.790
What's up?

07:27.240 --> 07:31.260
Hori-san and I are now going out,
but nothing has really changed.

07:32.060 --> 07:34.280
But just a little bit...

07:35.760 --> 07:38.229
Do you wanna come over today, Miyamura?

07:38.230 --> 07:40.020
Sure, if it's okay.

07:42.130 --> 07:44.060
Kyousuke's still there, though.

07:44.450 --> 07:45.790
Oh, okay.

07:47.790 --> 07:49.819
How long are you going to be here, Papa?

07:49.820 --> 07:53.819
Good question. If I leave,
you'll be lonely, right?

07:53.820 --> 07:54.889
Need to pee!

07:54.890 --> 07:56.949
Okay, go have fun!

07:56.950 --> 08:01.399
Let me ask you that
same question too, dear.

08:01.400 --> 08:02.409
Wh-Why?

08:02.410 --> 08:04.080
I'm back.

08:04.890 --> 08:06.959
Miyamura came over. Wanna see him?

08:06.960 --> 08:09.090
What?! Really?! Let me take a look!

08:09.640 --> 08:11.090
Thank you for having me over.

08:11.600 --> 08:12.869
What?

08:12.870 --> 08:15.259
He's the same Miyamura
that you're so fond of.

08:15.260 --> 08:18.969
What?! Oh, it really is you, Miyamura-kun!

08:18.970 --> 08:20.310
Thanks for having me over.

08:22.160 --> 08:23.979
How long are you going to stay, Kyousuke?

08:23.980 --> 08:27.639
I'm sick of, "How long are you going to
stay, Dad?" It's the collapse of Gestalt.

08:27.640 --> 08:30.530
I'd be nice if you collapsed as well.

08:31.300 --> 08:32.609
What's the matter, Kyouko?

08:32.610 --> 08:35.949
What's your blood type? S... blood type S?

08:35.950 --> 08:37.899
Get away, you dirty, middle-aged man.

08:37.900 --> 08:42.250
What? Do I really smell
that bad? Seriously?

08:43.260 --> 08:45.669
Why don't you take a shower, Izumi-kun?

08:45.670 --> 08:47.169
It was hot out, wasn't it?

08:47.170 --> 08:49.229
No, I'm fine.

08:49.230 --> 08:51.720
All right! How's about
taking a bath with pops?

08:52.410 --> 08:54.800
He really doesn't want to, Kyousuke.

08:55.310 --> 08:56.389
You really don't?

08:56.390 --> 08:57.759
Huh? Uh, I don't mind at all.

08:57.760 --> 09:00.150
Oh, really? Well, let's do it, okay?

09:02.680 --> 09:06.120
Sorry for it being so crowded in here.

09:08.410 --> 09:11.149
What's wrong? Are you
embarrassed, Miyamura-kun?

09:11.150 --> 09:12.939
No... Um...

09:12.940 --> 09:16.600
Don't worry. We're both the same gender.

09:18.510 --> 09:20.370
Please don't get surprised.

09:20.740 --> 09:23.040
Huh? Surprised? Surprised about wh...

09:26.270 --> 09:28.969
Hey, please stop bowing, sir!

09:28.970 --> 09:31.630
It's not what you think it is!

09:34.470 --> 09:36.339
What's the point of making
him more exhausted?

09:36.340 --> 09:39.709
Ow! Sorry, I went a bit overboard.

09:39.710 --> 09:41.560
Why does he talk so much?

09:42.520 --> 09:43.640
Miyamura...

09:44.430 --> 09:46.509
Dry your hair properly.

09:46.510 --> 09:48.440
Uh... okay.

09:48.830 --> 09:50.419
Yuriko, Yuriko!

09:50.420 --> 09:52.279
It's just like when we were young, huh?

09:52.280 --> 09:55.439
Huh? What's this all of a
sudden? That's hilarious.

09:55.440 --> 09:56.730
Why is it hilarious?

09:59.070 --> 10:01.330
Thank you for the meal!

10:02.630 --> 10:04.829
Oh, sorry, but I need to get going soon.

10:04.830 --> 10:07.339
You're leaving? Why
not spend the night here?

10:07.340 --> 10:09.669
Huh? That wouldn't be good, right?

10:09.670 --> 10:11.059
What should we do?

10:11.060 --> 10:12.989
We don't have a futon for you, dear.

10:12.990 --> 10:14.129
How come?

10:14.130 --> 10:16.859
Hey, wanna sleep in my room?

10:16.860 --> 10:18.069
No, that's okay.

10:18.070 --> 10:21.389
Nah, Miyamura-kun's going to sleep
in the living room with Dad.

10:21.390 --> 10:23.099
What? No fair!

10:23.100 --> 10:24.229
Hori-san!

10:24.230 --> 10:27.270
Once Kyousuke makes up his mind,
you can't change it.

10:28.090 --> 10:30.190
All right! Should we play mahjong?

10:30.500 --> 10:32.440
Hori-san!

10:35.430 --> 10:38.619
Sorry to make you sleep
with a middle-aged man like me.

10:38.620 --> 10:39.620
It's okay.

10:40.070 --> 10:41.369
Maybe you'd prefer Kyouko?

10:41.370 --> 10:43.080
No, not at all!

10:44.050 --> 10:47.410
Say, Miyamura-kun. What do you see in her?

10:51.070 --> 10:54.770
I think the part of her that doesn't judge
a person by their appearance.

11:08.580 --> 11:10.009
See you later!

11:10.010 --> 11:12.099
Okay. Have a nice day!

11:12.100 --> 11:14.009
Souta's so full of energy.

11:14.010 --> 11:15.049
And today?

11:15.050 --> 11:17.009
We only have classes
until noon today, right?

11:17.010 --> 11:18.010
Yeah.

11:19.350 --> 11:20.859
Should I see you two off?

11:20.860 --> 11:23.309
Don't you dare follow us. See you later!

11:23.310 --> 11:24.630
Thank you for having me over.

11:25.120 --> 11:29.120
You're supposed to say, "See you later"
when you leave in the morning, Izumi-kun.

11:29.580 --> 11:31.370
U-Uh, okay.

11:31.870 --> 11:33.059
See you later.

11:33.060 --> 11:34.880
Have a nice day.

11:39.760 --> 11:42.259
Didn't those two come
out of the same house?

11:42.260 --> 11:44.919
No way! Isn't that Hori-san from class 1?

11:44.920 --> 11:46.679
Seriously...

11:46.680 --> 11:47.960
Who's the guy next to her?

11:48.770 --> 11:50.739
What? With Miyamura-kun?

11:50.740 --> 11:52.139
That's surprising!

11:52.140 --> 11:54.579
Anyway, Miyamura's her boyfriend?

11:54.580 --> 11:55.709
What do you think?

11:55.710 --> 11:58.899
No way. If it's true, I'd be
a better match for her, right?

11:58.900 --> 12:02.490
Hey, Hori. Is it true that you're
going out with Miyamura?

12:03.310 --> 12:04.489
Yeah, it's true.

12:04.490 --> 12:05.490
Seriously?!

12:11.610 --> 12:14.960
The people making such a big deal
about it seriously pisses me off.

12:15.580 --> 12:17.939
It's not something you
should talk about so loudly!

12:17.940 --> 12:22.550
Yeah. And they were finally... able to...

12:24.420 --> 12:25.530
Miyamura...

12:27.050 --> 12:30.029
Why are <i>you</i> the one crying, Yoshikawa?

12:30.030 --> 12:31.030
Hey, wait...

12:38.870 --> 12:39.870
A sec...

12:40.820 --> 12:42.160
Geez!

12:46.030 --> 12:48.559
I heard she's going out with Miyamura.

12:48.560 --> 12:50.289
He's that gloomy guy, right?

12:50.290 --> 12:52.029
Hori's so hilarious.

12:52.030 --> 12:53.030
Right?

12:56.310 --> 12:58.199
Don't worry about it, Miyamura.

12:58.200 --> 13:00.210
They're all just stupid.

13:00.600 --> 13:03.090
I told Hori this too, but
just hold your head up high.

13:03.530 --> 13:05.470
It doesn't bother me.

13:12.070 --> 13:14.299
Hori, where's your boyfriend?

13:14.300 --> 13:16.230
Ditching class, huh?

13:16.630 --> 13:17.630
Ow, ow!

13:18.190 --> 13:20.099
Miyamura starts from the afternoon today.

13:20.100 --> 13:22.110
What gives, Ishikawa?

13:22.730 --> 13:24.610
Man, that hurt.

13:40.080 --> 13:41.080
Good morning.

13:48.220 --> 13:49.970
What?!

13:53.430 --> 13:55.319
Hey, let's go ask him.

13:55.320 --> 13:56.690
Why?

13:58.130 --> 14:00.999
Why did you cut your hair, Miyamura-kun?

14:01.000 --> 14:02.410
Huh? Well...

14:03.010 --> 14:04.820
It's summer, you see.

14:05.220 --> 14:06.839
He said it's because it's summer.

14:06.840 --> 14:09.369
Hey, why are you always wearing
the winter uniform?

14:09.370 --> 14:10.479
I get cold really easily.

14:10.480 --> 14:12.149
Your piercings are amazing!

14:12.150 --> 14:13.330
When did you get them?

14:14.120 --> 14:15.160
In junior high.

14:19.500 --> 14:21.670
She's like the Snow Queen.

14:22.410 --> 14:24.470
Am I going to freeze to death today?

14:25.340 --> 14:27.879
I think it's just temporary, Hori.

14:27.880 --> 14:29.760
Huh? What are you talking about?

14:30.520 --> 14:32.100
It's so cold over here.

14:32.680 --> 14:33.680
Heya!

14:35.950 --> 14:39.399
So you cut your hair,
Miyamura? It shocked me.

14:39.400 --> 14:43.590
Not like I have to say it, but you're the
one making the biggest deal out of it, Shuu.

14:44.120 --> 14:46.999
What's with those piercings, Miyamura-kun?

14:47.000 --> 14:48.959
Well, more like pierce holes.

14:48.960 --> 14:50.830
Huh? Um...

14:51.870 --> 14:53.129
I'll...

14:53.130 --> 14:55.950
die if I don't have
pierce holes in my ears.

14:56.280 --> 14:57.639
Oh, really?

14:57.640 --> 14:58.640
Yes.

14:59.140 --> 15:00.539
I see.

15:00.540 --> 15:03.089
I guess it can't be helped, then.

15:03.090 --> 15:06.210
Miyamura is amazing,
but our teacher is amazing, too.

15:10.840 --> 15:11.929
Good job.

15:11.930 --> 15:13.809
I'm going to go buy some juice.

15:13.810 --> 15:14.959
Be careful.

15:14.960 --> 15:15.960
Uh huh.

15:20.560 --> 15:22.770
Sorry, are you... okay?

15:23.670 --> 15:25.360
Miyamura-kun?

15:26.020 --> 15:28.909
Wait, what?! You cut your hair!

15:28.910 --> 15:31.240
Uh, w-wait! Please
turn off the water, first.

15:32.350 --> 15:33.799
Here, a towel.

15:33.800 --> 15:35.000
Thank you.

15:38.740 --> 15:41.219
Huh? You're not going
to take off your sweater?

15:41.220 --> 15:43.039
Huh? Uh...

15:43.040 --> 15:44.120
Nope.

15:45.220 --> 15:49.940
This has been bothering me for a while,
but why do you always cover up your skin?

15:50.420 --> 15:52.549
It's not that I...

15:52.550 --> 15:56.879
You didn't take a bath with the other
boys during our school trip, right?

15:56.880 --> 16:00.059
During PE, you don't swim,
and you sit out long-distance running.

16:00.060 --> 16:04.650
Sengoku-kun said that you change your clothes
in a bathroom stall or empty classroom.

16:06.380 --> 16:07.230
Stare...

16:07.230 --> 16:08.230
Um...

16:09.780 --> 16:10.820
What?!

16:11.560 --> 16:13.919
I just thought you
might actually be a girl.

16:13.920 --> 16:16.330
I don't look <i>that</i> feminine, you know!

16:16.970 --> 16:18.979
Remi, are you finished watering...

16:18.980 --> 16:20.580
Sengoku-kun!

16:19.460 --> 16:20.580
Oh, it's you, Prez.

16:21.300 --> 16:23.759
You bastard! What are you doing?!

16:23.760 --> 16:25.419
Trying to get alone with Remi!

16:25.420 --> 16:28.699
He's Miyamura-kun, Sengoku-kun.
That Miyamura-kun.

16:28.700 --> 16:31.220
What? That can't be true...

16:34.270 --> 16:35.710
Are you really Miyamura-kun?

16:38.580 --> 16:40.329
You've got so many holes in your ears!

16:40.330 --> 16:42.140
Don't tell me... you did this yourself?!

16:40.540 --> 16:41.540
Uh, hey! What?!

16:42.880 --> 16:45.060
Ow, ow! That hurts, Prez!

16:44.120 --> 16:45.060
This...

16:44.590 --> 16:45.800
Huh? What's going on?

16:45.060 --> 16:46.179
Stop it!

16:46.180 --> 16:47.459
That's Miyamura-kun.

16:47.460 --> 16:48.490
Got a problem?!

16:47.670 --> 16:48.490
He looks so cool!

16:48.491 --> 16:49.900
Ah!

16:52.650 --> 16:53.719
Tired?

16:53.720 --> 16:55.749
Huh? No, not at all.

16:55.750 --> 16:59.449
If you come over today, Kyousuke will
be there. What do you want to do?

16:59.450 --> 17:01.950
Oh, he's easier to deal with
than the girls from our class.

17:05.610 --> 17:08.420
Papa! Papa! His hair!

17:08.740 --> 17:10.830
It feels like I'm over here every day.

17:12.800 --> 17:15.019
Hey, who the hell are you?!

17:15.020 --> 17:18.389
Our daughter already has a boyfriend
who's my future son-in-law!

17:18.390 --> 17:21.329
If you like Miyamura,
try remembering how he looks.

17:21.330 --> 17:22.889
Ah, Miyamura-kun!

17:22.890 --> 17:24.500
You look so different! What happened?

17:23.520 --> 17:24.500
Hey!

17:24.501 --> 17:27.289
Burned! Don't let it get you down.

17:27.290 --> 17:29.749
If I'd broken his heart,
would I invite him over?

17:29.750 --> 17:32.650
Oh, tonight's dinner is the curry I made.

17:33.060 --> 17:34.650
Curry?

17:37.600 --> 17:39.990
Why did you cut your hair, Miyamura-kun?

17:40.530 --> 17:43.749
Um... because it was bothering me.

17:43.750 --> 17:45.610
I see...

17:46.780 --> 17:47.780
Is it from a girl?

17:49.190 --> 17:50.380
No, it's from a friend.

17:51.530 --> 17:53.110
Huh? Candy?

17:54.320 --> 17:56.399
I knew it. He didn't put carrots in it.

17:56.400 --> 17:57.820
Yay!

17:58.750 --> 18:00.749
Do you like candy, Hori-san?

18:00.750 --> 18:01.750
What?

18:12.590 --> 18:13.400
Shindo...

18:13.401 --> 18:14.900
What are you doing?

18:17.030 --> 18:19.035
Miyamura you... Miyamura you...

18:19.036 --> 18:20.079
Hey! Wait!

18:20.080 --> 18:21.330
My Miyamura has...

18:22.640 --> 18:25.359
Hurry up and bring the candy inside.

18:25.360 --> 18:26.800
Miyamura...

18:29.130 --> 18:31.210
A year's supply of candy.

18:31.560 --> 18:34.489
I won it online. Isn't it cool?

18:34.490 --> 18:37.920
Hey, Baron Candy. There
are only weird flavors.

18:38.300 --> 18:39.899
Who are you calling a baron?

18:39.900 --> 18:40.480
Baron.

18:40.481 --> 18:41.819
Shindo!

18:41.820 --> 18:43.119
Baron Shindo.

18:43.120 --> 18:44.580
You're so stubborn.

18:46.810 --> 18:49.069
Aren't there any normal
flavors, like lemon?

18:49.070 --> 18:52.739
Chika took all the normal flavors.

18:52.740 --> 18:54.690
What flavor is that, Hori-san?

18:55.080 --> 18:57.109
Um... cheese?

18:57.110 --> 19:00.229
Shindo, if I recall correctly,
you hate cheese, right?

19:00.230 --> 19:03.240
I'd rather throw my wallet
in the gutter than eat cheese.

19:03.540 --> 19:05.330
Okay, say, "Aah."

19:03.990 --> 19:06.040
Cheese Flavor

19:07.270 --> 19:09.309
Miyamura's telling me to say "Aah."

19:09.310 --> 19:11.160
This may be a once in a lifetime chance.

19:12.260 --> 19:14.860
But... But it's cheese, though!

19:20.340 --> 19:21.469
Is it good?

19:21.470 --> 19:23.559
How could it be good?

19:23.560 --> 19:25.420
Ugh! Give me some water.

19:27.880 --> 19:30.629
You two are pretty strange, you know.

19:30.630 --> 19:31.630
Really?

19:33.660 --> 19:34.879
What flavor is it?

19:34.880 --> 19:35.930
Flavor?

19:38.900 --> 19:40.149
Clay?

19:40.150 --> 19:41.180
Clay?!

20:02.890 --> 20:05.550
Can you make me some coffee, Miyamura?

20:05.980 --> 20:07.299
What a pain.

20:07.300 --> 20:09.310
You're the one who made me eat it!

20:12.030 --> 20:13.790
What's wrong, Hori-san?

20:16.480 --> 20:18.409
He took my candy.

20:18.410 --> 20:20.029
Really?! What flavor was it?

20:20.030 --> 20:22.080
There's still a lot left. Look. Look!

20:26.650 --> 20:28.459
She was right.

20:28.460 --> 20:29.590
It tastes like clay.

20:31.210 --> 20:36.469
kinou no yoru ni hanashita

20:31.210 --> 20:36.469
The promise that

20:31.250 --> 20:36.690
Translator tenkenX6

20:36.470 --> 20:41.679
futari dake no yakusoku wa

20:36.470 --> 20:41.679
we made last night.

20:36.691 --> 20:42.130
Timers Mamo-chan, ninjacloud

20:41.680 --> 20:47.299
kore kara tsudzuku nagai michi to

20:41.680 --> 20:47.299
About the long road ahead of us

20:47.300 --> 20:52.099
mirai wo miteta ne

20:47.300 --> 20:52.099
and what the future might hold.

20:52.100 --> 20:57.459
kigatsuitara soba ni ite

20:52.100 --> 20:57.459
When I realized it, you were next to me.

20:57.460 --> 21:02.799
shinpai de hanashi kaketa

20:57.460 --> 21:02.799
You said something to me
because you were worried.

21:02.800 --> 21:08.349
ano hi no ano kimochi wa ima mo

21:02.800 --> 21:08.349
My feelings back then

21:08.350 --> 21:14.009
kawaranai kara ne

21:08.350 --> 21:14.009
won't ever change.

21:14.010 --> 21:22.010
hora vaga vaga yureru minareta
machinami ga bokura wa yasashiku tsutsumu

21:14.010 --> 21:22.010
Look! The wavering image of the
nostalgic townscape gently envelops us.

21:26.380 --> 21:34.380
zutto kono mama kawaranai
mama to haba awaseru

21:26.380 --> 21:34.380
We stand closer together as we wish
things would never change between us.

21:37.270 --> 21:45.270
mado kara sasu hikari heya no
katasumi ni wa nigirareta futari no te to

21:37.270 --> 21:45.270
The light shines through the window to the corner
of the room where we both are holding hands.

21:37.270 --> 21:42.360
Editors Mamo-chan, Collectr

21:42.361 --> 21:47.449
Typesetter Collectr

21:47.450 --> 21:55.219
kioku wo tadoru namida no kiseki soba ni

21:47.450 --> 21:55.219
It's the miraculous tears created
from us reliving our memories.

21:47.450 --> 21:52.705
Quality Check Chibiki, TougeWolf

21:52.706 --> 21:57.960
Encoder Eternzal_Blizzard

21:55.220 --> 22:03.220
iru kara kimi ga stay

21:55.220 --> 22:03.220
I'm here by your side, so stay with me.
